1
00:02:06,140 --> 00:02:07,690
What the hell?!

2
00:02:10,480 --> 00:02:12,570
Which one of you is Arlong?!

3
00:02:16,570 --> 00:02:17,900
Arlong?

4
00:02:20,570 --> 00:02:23,120
That'd be me.

5
00:02:23,740 --> 00:02:25,200
I'm Luffy.

6
00:02:25,200 --> 00:02:26,700
Luffy?

7
00:02:27,290 --> 00:02:29,080
So, what are you?

8
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:30,670
A pirate!

9
00:02:34,460 --> 00:02:36,510
Hold it, you bastard.

10
00:02:37,550 --> 00:02:39,340
Where'dya think you're goin'?!

11
00:02:39,970 --> 00:02:44,810
You need to run things 
by us first, kiddo.

12
00:02:45,350 --> 00:02:47,810
– Yeah!
– If you don't stop...

13
00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:49,980
Move!

14
00:02:57,230 --> 00:02:59,700
What does a pirate want with me?

15
00:03:24,970 --> 00:03:27,220
Who the hell are you?

16
00:03:45,570 --> 00:03:46,660
Luffy,

17
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:49,040
help me!

18
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:52,160
I won't let you make our navigator cry!

19
00:03:53,710 --> 00:03:54,580
Why, you...

20
00:03:54,580 --> 00:03:57,290
How dare you insult Arlong!

21
00:03:59,210 --> 00:04:02,260
Butt out, small fries!

22
00:04:04,970 --> 00:04:09,310
Yeesh. You just had to run 
on ahead by yourself.

23
00:04:09,310 --> 00:04:11,810
It's not like I'd lose on my own.

24
00:04:11,810 --> 00:04:16,110
Idiot! When did I say 
I was worried about you?!

25
00:04:17,310 --> 00:04:19,860
I just don't want you
hogging all the prey!

26
00:04:19,860 --> 00:04:20,820
Oh!

27
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:26,950
I-I don't mind if you 
hog them all, though!

28
00:04:26,990 --> 00:04:29,540
You sure got some guts.

29
00:04:31,580 --> 00:04:35,620
That's him!
He's the unknown swordsman!

30
00:04:35,620 --> 00:04:37,040
It's Roronoa Zoro.

31
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:42,420
Yeah? Yeah, I thought so!
He tricked me!

32
00:04:42,420 --> 00:04:43,970
He completely took me for a ride...

33
00:04:43,970 --> 00:04:47,010
No, wait. Didn't I give him a ride?

34
00:04:47,010 --> 00:04:48,600
Look! It's that long-nosed guy!

35
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:53,230
D-Didn't Nami kill him?!

36
00:04:53,230 --> 00:04:55,980
The bastard's alive. Which means...

37
00:04:56,690 --> 00:04:59,060
It's just like I thought, then.

38
00:04:59,690 --> 00:05:02,610
The girl was a traitor all along!

39
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:12,540
Hey! Who are those guys?!

40
00:05:13,330 --> 00:05:14,410
Hold it!

41
00:05:16,210 --> 00:05:18,540
He sent Arlong flying!

42
00:05:18,540 --> 00:05:20,090
Unbelievable!

43
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:24,170
No ordinary human could do that!

44
00:05:24,170 --> 00:05:25,630
They're...

45
00:05:26,180 --> 00:05:29,640
Do you still want to 
try to break in now?

46
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:33,140
Your presence would stall the fight.

47
00:05:33,140 --> 00:05:35,140
You'll only get in their way!

48
00:05:35,140 --> 00:05:38,810
B-But, why are they fighting?

49
00:05:38,810 --> 00:05:41,400
What reason do they have to fight?!

50
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:42,900
Reason to fight?

51
00:05:45,530 --> 00:05:47,610
Big Sis Nami was crying!

52
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:52,120
Do they need any more reason than that...

53
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:54,240
to put their lives on the line?

54
00:05:58,290 --> 00:06:01,040
A pirate, huh? I see.

55
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:03,750
So that's what your guys' deal is.

56
00:06:04,670 --> 00:06:07,420
You were after Nami 
from the very start.

57
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:08,550
However,

58
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:13,010
what can you four lowbred
worms possibly do?!

59
00:06:15,140 --> 00:06:18,810
Fool! You're not worth Arlong's time!

60
00:06:18,810 --> 00:06:20,850
I've got something that'll be more than enough to handle you!

61
00:06:32,570 --> 00:06:33,870
No!

62
00:06:33,870 --> 00:06:35,410
It's coming!

63
00:06:38,710 --> 00:06:41,630
What the... What the...
What's going on?!

64
00:06:41,630 --> 00:06:44,460
Rise, Momoo!

65
00:06:50,930 --> 00:06:52,930
A-A monster!

66
00:06:52,930 --> 00:06:56,520
It's the Grand Line monster that 
destroyed the town of Gosa!

67
00:07:08,860 --> 00:07:10,650
It's here!

68
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:13,530
Th-That's...

69
00:07:13,530 --> 00:07:15,120
The fearsome sea cow, Momoo!

70
00:07:21,500 --> 00:07:22,670
Oh, it's him?

71
00:07:22,670 --> 00:07:24,420
He's a friend of the fishmen?

72
00:07:28,210 --> 00:07:31,180
Wait! Momoo! 
Where are you going?!

73
00:07:31,180 --> 00:07:34,800
Hey! Stop! Get back here! Momoo!

74
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:39,810
Momoo. What are you doing?

75
00:07:43,980 --> 00:07:49,110
Though, if you wanna run away,
I won't stop you.

76
00:07:51,110 --> 00:07:53,320
Understand, Momoo?

77
00:08:01,790 --> 00:08:03,750
Here it comes!

78
00:08:03,750 --> 00:08:06,040
– Alright!
– Follow Momoo!

79
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:13,380
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
I'm so sorry!

80
00:08:16,640 --> 00:08:19,600
I'll do it! This is a waste of time!

81
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:31,150
What's he planning now?!

82
00:08:31,150 --> 00:08:34,200
I don't have a very good 
feeling about this.

83
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:53,760
His arms stretched!

84
00:08:55,880 --> 00:08:58,300
He has a devil fruit power?!

85
00:08:58,300 --> 00:09:00,140
– What?!
– Who cares!

86
00:09:00,140 --> 00:09:01,350
Go!

87
00:09:03,230 --> 00:09:04,180
Whoa! Run!

88
00:09:04,180 --> 00:09:06,190
What? What's he doing?!

89
00:09:06,190 --> 00:09:07,650
I dunno, but it doesn't look good!

90
00:09:08,770 --> 00:09:15,240
Gum-Gum...

91
00:09:15,950 --> 00:09:21,200
Pinwheel!

92
00:09:48,560 --> 00:09:52,360
I didn't come here to 
take on these guys!

93
00:09:52,860 --> 00:09:55,320
The one I wanna beat up...

94
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:57,650
is you!

95
00:09:58,660 --> 00:10:00,950
That's perfect, then.

96
00:10:02,490 --> 00:10:06,710
I was just now thinking of killing you.

97
00:10:06,710 --> 00:10:09,040
That was dangerous, you moron!

98
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:11,790
Are you trying to kill us, too?!

99
00:10:18,010 --> 00:10:20,510
What incredible power!

100
00:10:20,510 --> 00:10:24,890
I wouldn't have believed that any human could throw that giant beast!

101
00:10:24,890 --> 00:10:27,930
Is this fight some kind of dream?

102
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:33,400
How dare you hurt our brothers!

103
00:10:34,570 --> 00:10:38,650
It would seem we need to fight, too.

104
00:10:38,650 --> 00:10:42,530
Looks like we need to teach them
the differences between our races.

105
00:10:42,530 --> 00:10:45,490
The main forces finally show up, huh?

106
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:51,920
Arlong, please just relax.

107
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:58,010
If you lose your temper,
you'll lay waste to Arlong Park.

108
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:04,390
We'll take care of these guys!

109
00:11:04,390 --> 00:11:06,770
Alright, do as you wish.

110
00:11:08,430 --> 00:11:10,520
Yikes!

111
00:11:11,190 --> 00:11:13,400
Hey. Hey, guys. 
There's something I...

112
00:11:18,650 --> 00:11:20,450
That octopus is up to something.

113
00:11:21,070 --> 00:11:24,120
Octopus is best boiled with a little salt and sliced up.

114
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:28,290
Add some olive oil and paprika, and 
it's a perfect snack while drinking.

115
00:11:28,290 --> 00:11:30,910
Hey, I'm kind of in trouble. 
Hear me out.

116
00:11:30,910 --> 00:11:33,130
See how you like having no vision!

117
00:11:33,130 --> 00:11:35,460
Takohachi Black!

118
00:11:40,380 --> 00:11:42,590
You idiot! Why didn't you dodge?!

119
00:11:44,180 --> 00:11:46,560
I can't see!

120
00:11:47,560 --> 00:11:49,350
Now to finish you off!

121
00:11:52,350 --> 00:11:54,310
Hey, Luffy! Run!

122
00:11:55,020 --> 00:11:57,270
Yeah, that's the problem.

123
00:11:58,480 --> 00:12:00,570
I can't seem to move!

124
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,530
Huh?!

125
00:12:03,530 --> 00:12:06,030
M-My feet are stuck!

126
00:12:06,490 --> 00:12:09,450
You're the one who stuck 
them in the ground!

127
00:12:09,450 --> 00:12:11,710
Why would he do that?!

128
00:12:13,170 --> 00:12:16,460
Takohachi Black on the Rocks!

129
00:12:37,940 --> 00:12:40,280
What a pain.

130
00:12:40,730 --> 00:12:43,240
Sanji! That was amazing!

131
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:47,570
Seems I've wound up following
one hell of an idiot of a captain.

132
00:12:47,570 --> 00:12:49,080
Agreed.

133
00:12:49,490 --> 00:12:52,000
He's... awesome!

134
00:12:53,210 --> 00:12:58,710
But he's 100 times better than
some damn gang that'd hurt a lady.

135
00:13:00,300 --> 00:13:01,760
Lady?

136
00:13:03,380 --> 00:13:06,930
You're pretty crazy to bust in here
just for that one lousy girl.

137
00:13:06,930 --> 00:13:08,760
Lousy girl?

138
00:13:09,430 --> 00:13:11,890
Just try and insult
Nami one more time.

139
00:13:11,930 --> 00:13:15,940
I'll panfry you in butter, monsieur fish fry!

140
00:13:15,940 --> 00:13:19,230
You seem somewhat
skilled for a human.

141
00:13:19,230 --> 00:13:23,530
Any sort of chivalry from a pirate
is bound to be half-hearted.

142
00:13:25,610 --> 00:13:28,870
Go ahead and see if my chivalry 
is half-hearted or not.

143
00:13:28,870 --> 00:13:32,580
I spent half my life
raised by a tough-as-nails pirate.

144
00:13:35,290 --> 00:13:40,340
It appears you don't know the true 
power of the fishman race.

145
00:13:52,350 --> 00:13:54,270
They're still really stuck.

146
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:57,230
Still?! They're still stuck?!

147
00:13:58,520 --> 00:14:00,360
Yep, they're still stuck.

148
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:03,230
I get the feeling just pulling
me won't get them unstuck.

149
00:14:03,230 --> 00:14:06,700
Are you even trying?! Are you even
trying to get your legs out?!

150
00:14:06,700 --> 00:14:11,660
Why're they playing around here in Arlong Park?

151
00:14:12,030 --> 00:14:13,790
I'll kill them!

152
00:14:14,660 --> 00:14:17,620
Hey, you! Get unstuck already!

153
00:14:19,580 --> 00:14:21,080
Get back here!

154
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:22,420
Hey, octopus.

155
00:14:22,790 --> 00:14:24,880
They're busy right now.

156
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:27,840
I'll take you on.

157
00:14:29,050 --> 00:14:31,850
Roronoa Zoro! Yeah! I forgot!

158
00:14:32,350 --> 00:14:34,600
How dare you trick me!

159
00:14:38,060 --> 00:14:43,060
Yeah! And you cut down
tons of my brothers!

160
00:14:43,060 --> 00:14:45,530
I'm not interested 
in these old stories.

161
00:14:46,030 --> 00:14:50,360
It doesn't matter what reasons
you have for wanting to kill me.

162
00:14:50,950 --> 00:14:53,330
The situation's changed now!

163
00:14:53,780 --> 00:14:56,370
You're not trying to destroy us.

164
00:14:56,370 --> 00:14:59,290
We're trying to destroy you!

165
00:15:04,290 --> 00:15:09,420
A-Alright, Zoro!
That octopus is all yours! Nice!

166
00:15:10,090 --> 00:15:11,380
Luffy!

167
00:15:17,770 --> 00:15:19,520
I'm back.

168
00:15:22,310 --> 00:15:23,690
Why, you...

169
00:15:24,190 --> 00:15:26,150
My bad!

170
00:15:26,150 --> 00:15:30,110
Seems you really do 
want me to kill you.

171
00:15:34,990 --> 00:15:38,950
Wasn't that the guy
who saved Gen?

172
00:15:41,540 --> 00:15:43,960
You're the people from 
Cocoyashi Village!

173
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:44,920
Oh?

174
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:49,920
Judging from the fact you have 
weapons, I take it this is a rebellion?

175
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:51,220
Then you're all–

176
00:15:51,220 --> 00:15:52,680
Exploding Star!

177
00:15:53,390 --> 00:15:54,390
Big Bro Usopp!

178
00:15:57,350 --> 00:16:01,310
I'm your opponent!

179
00:16:03,310 --> 00:16:06,270
If you wanna die that badly,
I'll finish you right now!

180
00:16:09,230 --> 00:16:11,490
Just who is that lad?

181
00:16:11,490 --> 00:16:15,410
He's brave one minute, then runs 
away the next. He's a baffling man.

182
00:16:18,370 --> 00:16:20,250
Get back here, schnoz!

183
00:16:20,250 --> 00:16:22,330
Well, you got a big mouth!

184
00:16:23,370 --> 00:16:25,750
Why are these people pirates?!

185
00:16:30,710 --> 00:16:35,590
You're all pathetic. Move.
I'm sick of watching this.

186
00:16:35,590 --> 00:16:40,060
Arlong! We asked you
not to go on a rampage!

187
00:16:40,060 --> 00:16:44,520
I won't. I just thought up a fun game.

188
00:16:45,940 --> 00:16:50,610
I'm gonna clobber you!

189
00:16:51,990 --> 00:16:55,820
Do you really think you can beat us?

190
00:16:55,820 --> 00:16:57,820
So what if we do?

191
00:16:57,820 --> 00:17:01,290
We do, idiot! Let go!

192
00:17:01,290 --> 00:17:03,290
Sounds like he has something to say.

193
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:12,760
What the... What the...

194
00:17:14,670 --> 00:17:17,680
People with devil fruit
powers can't swim!

195
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:22,350
Though, even people without powers 
would sink in this situation!

196
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:25,890
He's gonna throw him into the sea?!

197
00:17:26,600 --> 00:17:29,480
Gum-Gum Pistol!

198
00:17:32,070 --> 00:17:34,990
Oww!

199
00:17:34,990 --> 00:17:35,950
You fool.

200
00:17:36,950 --> 00:17:39,450
Damn you!

201
00:17:39,450 --> 00:17:41,410
How pointless.

202
00:17:46,290 --> 00:17:47,080
Luffy!

203
00:17:47,080 --> 00:17:48,540
You bastard!

204
00:17:58,550 --> 00:17:59,600
I'm coming to save–

205
00:17:59,600 --> 00:18:01,470
Idiot! Don't get worked up!

206
00:18:01,970 --> 00:18:04,810
They want us to go in the water!

207
00:18:04,810 --> 00:18:08,600
The fishmen would obviously have 
the advantage in an underwater fight!

208
00:18:09,480 --> 00:18:11,730
There's only one way to save Luffy!

209
00:18:12,900 --> 00:18:16,400
Take these guys down tout de suite,
then go into the water?

210
00:18:17,700 --> 00:18:19,570
Let's do it! There's no time!

211
00:18:19,570 --> 00:18:20,370
Yeah!

212
00:18:20,370 --> 00:18:24,370
Just how many seconds will 
the rubber man hold out?

213
00:18:24,370 --> 00:18:26,330
Oh, so that's the game?

214
00:18:26,330 --> 00:18:27,460
I see.

215
00:18:30,750 --> 00:18:32,460
You can have the fish.

216
00:18:33,130 --> 00:18:35,260
You can dress the octopus.

217
00:18:57,990 --> 00:19:00,700
This is bad.
I feel so weak.

218
00:19:01,530 --> 00:19:04,580
What do we do?!
He can't help himself now!

219
00:19:04,580 --> 00:19:06,490
Big Bro Luffy's going to die!

220
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:17,380
They can't even breathe underwater.

221
00:19:17,380 --> 00:19:20,630
Humans are utterly pitiful creatures!

222
00:19:22,390 --> 00:19:25,600
Bring it on! 
I'll cross swords with you, octofreak!

223
00:19:29,850 --> 00:19:31,310
I'm game!

224
00:19:31,310 --> 00:19:33,730
I'll take care of you in five seconds!

225
00:19:34,520 --> 00:19:35,820
No, three seconds!

226
00:19:36,270 --> 00:19:37,860
Don't be in such a rush.

227
00:19:38,690 --> 00:19:42,780
No matter what happens, none of you have any hope of surviving!

228
00:20:02,590 --> 00:20:07,390
I-I'm dead meat!

229
00:20:07,760 --> 00:20:09,560
I'll defeat him in 
five seconds, Luffy!

230
00:20:09,560 --> 00:20:10,730
I'll come rescue you at once!

231
00:20:10,730 --> 00:20:12,600
Takohachi Black!

232
00:20:20,690 --> 00:20:22,900
My hair! You bastard!

233
00:20:22,900 --> 00:20:25,870
I'm gonna...

234
00:20:25,870 --> 00:20:27,240
forgive you.

235
00:20:27,240 --> 00:20:29,870
It's just hair, so it'll grow back.

236
00:20:29,410 --> 00:20:29,870
Huh?

237
00:20:29,870 --> 00:20:31,330
Roronoa Zoro!

238
00:20:31,330 --> 00:20:35,460
You can't cut me because
I have six hands.

239
00:20:35,460 --> 00:20:37,590
Go ahead and cut me if you can!

240
00:20:37,590 --> 00:20:38,170
You octofreak!

241
00:20:38,170 --> 00:20:39,130
OctoTriple Razor Sharp Blade Grab!

242
00:20:39,130 --> 00:20:40,070
Octo Triple Razor Sharp Blade Grab!

243
00:20:40,070 --> 00:20:40,880
Octo Triple Razor Sharp Blade Grab!

244
00:20:40,880 --> 00:20:41,670
Octo Triple Razor Sharp Blade Grab!

245
00:20:41,670 --> 00:20:42,510
Octo Triple Razor Sharp Blade Grab!

246
00:20:42,510 --> 00:20:43,300
Octo Triple Razor Sharp Blade Grab!

247
00:20:43,300 --> 00:20:44,180
Octo Triple Razor Sharp Blade Grab!

248
00:20:44,180 --> 00:20:45,090
Octo Triple Razor Sharp Blade Grab!

249
00:20:47,890 --> 00:20:49,560
Ouch!

250
00:20:49,560 --> 00:20:51,350
I don't have time to play with you!

251
00:20:53,060 --> 00:20:54,390
He throws me off my rhythm.

252
00:20:55,310 --> 00:20:57,360
You won't live long,
if you're not paying attention!

253
00:20:57,360 --> 00:21:00,360
Fish shouldn't take on a cook!

254
00:21:00,820 --> 00:21:03,530
We're running out of time. There's no time!

255
00:21:04,900 --> 00:21:06,660
Just drop dead already!

256
00:21:10,160 --> 00:21:13,710
Takohachi Number Nine!

257
00:21:15,580 --> 00:21:18,290
So what?! Come down already!

258
00:21:21,250 --> 00:21:24,760
That octopus bastard!
He's meandering and dawdling!

259
00:21:24,760 --> 00:21:26,760
But then, if he goes
into the sea now,

260
00:21:26,760 --> 00:21:29,220
he'll be dragged to
the bottom of the sea.

261
00:21:29,220 --> 00:21:32,520
But at this rate,
Big Bro Luffy's going to die!

262
00:21:32,520 --> 00:21:34,390
We have to do something about it!

263
00:21:34,390 --> 00:21:34,980
Yeah!

264
00:21:34,980 --> 00:21:35,440
Wait!

265
00:21:35,440 --> 00:21:36,890
Ouch!

266
00:21:36,890 --> 00:21:40,650
What're you going to do in
the sea with such serious injuries?

267
00:21:41,570 --> 00:21:44,320
You can't do much like that.

268
00:21:44,900 --> 00:21:48,110
If you're talking about that young rubber man, I'll go and rescue him.

269
00:21:48,570 --> 00:21:49,660
Y-You will?

270
00:21:49,660 --> 00:21:51,740
I'll go, too! I'll go as well!

271
00:21:51,740 --> 00:21:52,870
Me, too!

272
00:21:52,870 --> 00:21:58,000
No! If a lot of us go and take time 
rescuing him, the fishmen will notice.

273
00:21:58,000 --> 00:22:00,840
It will just cause these people trouble, if anything.

274
00:22:00,840 --> 00:22:01,710
Gen!

275
00:22:01,710 --> 00:22:06,300
It'll be pointless if we end up
interfering with their fight.

276
00:22:06,300 --> 00:22:07,680
So I'll do it alone.

277
00:22:08,470 --> 00:22:10,680
Sorry. Thank you!

278
00:22:10,720 --> 00:22:14,220
I'll leave it to you.
Sorry, but please be quick.

279
00:22:14,220 --> 00:22:15,390
Wait!

280
00:22:16,140 --> 00:22:18,350
Gen, I'll go too.

281
00:22:18,350 --> 00:22:20,560
Nojiko, you're injured!

282
00:22:20,560 --> 00:22:24,230
Those guys're fighting
for my little sister!

283
00:22:26,740 --> 00:22:27,860
Gen!

284
00:22:31,620 --> 00:22:33,740
Okay. Come on!

285
00:22:33,740 --> 00:22:34,490
Let's hurry!

286
00:22:34,490 --> 00:22:35,200
Okay!

287
00:22:36,790 --> 00:22:38,250
I'm sorry!

288
00:22:38,250 --> 00:22:41,170
If only we were a little stronger...

289
00:22:41,170 --> 00:22:44,630
Please save Big Bro!

290
00:22:54,810 --> 00:22:57,730
You damn fish bastard!

291
00:23:04,070 --> 00:23:07,860
Roronoa Zoro! Do you mind if I ask
you a question? You don't, right?

292
00:23:07,860 --> 00:23:10,270
I heard you use three-sword style.

293
00:23:10,270 --> 00:23:11,740
Why are you using only one sword?

294
00:23:11,740 --> 00:23:14,330
You're already losing
fairly badly with one sword!

295
00:23:14,330 --> 00:23:17,040
Sh-Shut up! I'm not taking this seriously!

296
00:23:17,040 --> 00:23:21,790
Actually, there's a reason that
a human swordsman can't defeat me.

297
00:23:21,790 --> 00:23:23,670
Wanna hear what it is?
You wanna hear it, right?

298
00:23:23,670 --> 00:23:27,000
When you hear it, you'll be
surprised, scared, blown away!

299
00:23:27,710 --> 00:23:30,970
Dammit! I can't be in pain right now!

300
00:23:31,430 --> 00:23:34,430
My fever's getting worse, too!

301
00:23:34,430 --> 00:23:37,720
I thought it would come down
while I was moving around, but...

302
00:23:45,060 --> 00:23:46,650
Just as I thought, it's the wounds...

303
00:23:48,610 --> 00:23:50,610
from your fight with Hawk Eye!

304
00:23:51,150 --> 00:23:52,320
Big Bro!

305
00:23:52,320 --> 00:23:53,740
What're you doing?

306
00:23:53,740 --> 00:23:56,530
Are you trying to fake
an illness or something?

307
00:23:56,530 --> 00:23:59,120
I won't fall for that. Roronoa Zoro!

308
00:23:59,120 --> 00:24:01,870
Just check out my true form!

309
00:24:05,380 --> 00:24:08,050
Look! This is my true form!

310
00:24:08,050 --> 00:24:10,720
Here comes Hachi,
user of the six-sword style!

311
00:24:10,720 --> 00:24:14,640
Hey! That's not when you're
supposed to fall! Don't mock me!

312
00:24:17,220 --> 00:24:18,640
Ah! Big Bro!

313
00:24:18,640 --> 00:24:20,890
So he was bearing the pain!

314
00:24:20,890 --> 00:24:23,350
Yeah. His injuries would kill a normal person

315
00:24:23,350 --> 00:24:26,610
or leave them bedridden for half a year!

316
00:24:26,610 --> 00:24:27,440
What?!

317
00:24:30,360 --> 00:24:32,280
I thought something was strange.

318
00:24:32,280 --> 00:24:35,990
He looked as if nothing had happened
right after that fierce fight.

319
00:24:35,990 --> 00:24:37,370
Is he an idiot or what?!

320
00:24:45,120 --> 00:24:48,250
I thought I warned you 
to pay attention.

321
00:24:48,250 --> 00:24:50,670
I have a 40th degree
in Fishman Karate.

322
00:24:50,670 --> 00:24:54,550
Wh-What? Someone went flying?!

323
00:24:54,550 --> 00:24:56,340
B-Big Bro?!

324
00:24:56,340 --> 00:24:57,760
Big Bro Cook!

325
00:24:58,220 --> 00:24:59,430
Ahh...

326
00:25:01,220 --> 00:25:04,230
Big Bro Cook!

327
00:25:09,150 --> 00:25:11,400
He's been taken care of, Arlong.

328
00:25:11,400 --> 00:25:13,440
What do we do with Roronoa Zoro?

329
00:25:13,440 --> 00:25:18,660
Just ditch him in the sea.
What weaklings. How boring!

330
00:25:21,740 --> 00:25:22,620
That's all?

331
00:25:22,620 --> 00:25:26,370
Geez, they sure did
a lot of damage, though.

332
00:25:26,370 --> 00:25:28,040
It's no big deal.

333
00:25:28,040 --> 00:25:31,130
Arlong Park can't be destroyed
by this kind of damage.

334
00:25:31,130 --> 00:25:32,590
Indeed.

335
00:25:33,710 --> 00:25:36,300
How dare you, Roronoa Zoro!

336
00:25:36,300 --> 00:25:39,800
You died from shock before I, the 
great swordsman, could attack you?!

337
00:25:39,800 --> 00:25:43,520
History would have remembered you,
had you fallen to my six-sword style.

338
00:25:43,520 --> 00:25:45,210
Well, no matter how much you struggled,

339
00:25:45,210 --> 00:25:47,020
or even if the sun were to rise in the west,

340
00:25:47,020 --> 00:25:53,190
no human could ever lay a hand on me, the wielder of six swords!

341
00:26:01,620 --> 00:26:05,120
Stop it, Hachi. I know how you feel,

342
00:26:05,120 --> 00:26:07,620
but if you really go on a
rampage, we'll be in trouble.

343
00:26:07,620 --> 00:26:09,330
Are you trying to destroy Arlong Park?

344
00:26:09,330 --> 00:26:11,130
Oh! Ahh...

345
00:26:11,130 --> 00:26:13,050
N-No. Sorry.

346
00:26:13,550 --> 00:26:16,050
I got too worked up.

347
00:26:16,510 --> 00:26:17,760
Don't get carried away.

348
00:26:17,760 --> 00:26:19,800
You're right. Sorry.

349
00:26:20,800 --> 00:26:23,510
Six-sword style, huh?
What a joke!

350
00:26:33,570 --> 00:26:35,070
Big Bro!

351
00:26:37,150 --> 00:26:39,320
Roronoa Zoro!

352
00:26:39,320 --> 00:26:41,780
I'll tell you one thing, octopus.

353
00:26:42,330 --> 00:26:45,290
There's a man I must see again.

354
00:26:45,830 --> 00:26:49,040
Until that happens,

355
00:26:50,630 --> 00:26:54,300
even the God of Death can't take my life!
